й. Полный дизайн — следующим шагом.", "required_handoff_stage": "plan", "approach_approved": false, "public_task": {"question": "Does the automatic scheduling algorithm’s output (ZB-2p) truly achieve a near-zero bubble rate in practice when profiled on multiple GPUs? (Note: The ZB-2p schedule should be activated by setting the appropriate zero bubble configuration flag, for example --zero-bubble-max-pending-backward set to twice the number of pipeline stages.)", "context": "Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.", "environment": {"runtime": "bubblewrap", "network": "disabled", "repository": "/workspace", "python": "python3", "software_environment": "system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled", "datasets": [], "gpu_enabled": false, "cpu_affinity_count": 224, "note": "Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment."}, "researcher_topics": [], "question_budget": 6, "actor_step_budget": 60, "continue_after_initial_plan": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null, "reasoning_content": null, "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "critic_result": null, "kind": "MessageEvent"}
